@url = http://localhost:3000/rectangulos

### Crear rectángulo
POST {{url}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "base": 4, "altura": 6 }

### Crear cuadrado
POST {{url}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "base": 5, "altura": 5 }

### Crear inválido (400)
POST {{url}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "base": -2, "altura": "hola" }

### Listar todos
GET {{url}}

### Solo cuadrados
GET {{url}}?cuadrado=true

### Solo no cuadrados
GET {{url}}?cuadrado=false

### Query inválida (400)
GET {{url}}?cuadrado=quizas

### Obtener por id
GET {{url}}/1

### Id inválido (400)
GET {{url}}/abc

### No existe (404)
GET {{url}}/999

### Modificar
PUT {{url}}/1
Content-Type: application/json

{ "base": 3, "altura": 3 }

### Eliminar
DELETE {{url}}/2